            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "InflaRx (IFRX) Is Up 17.7% After INF904 Shows Promising Results in Phase 2a Study\u2014What's Changed",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "InflaRx recently announced positive topline data from its Phase 2a basket study of oral C5aR inhibitor INF904 in hidradenitis suppurativa and chronic spontaneous urticaria, with rapid and durable improvements in clinical endpoints and no serious adverse events reported. An interesting insight is that efficacy measures for INF904 compared favorably with those of currently approved therapies, with continued benefits seen even after treatment ended. We'll explore how these promising efficacy...",
